{
 "about": "PBR presets for splat2mesh. metallic/roughness for UsdPreviewSurface (metallic-roughness workflow); ior for dielectrics; f0 = linear reflectance at normal incidence used as base colour for metals (values from widely used physically-based reference charts, e.g. Lagarde's and Hoffman's). roughness is a typical value for the finish named; 'range' gives the plausible span. These are catalogue values, not measurements. transmission/subsurface/thin_walled feed a MaterialX standard_surface (translucent and glass parts); UsdPreviewSurface gets opacity\u22481-0.9\u00b7transmission. Roughness values were raised (2026-11-03) from showroom-polished to used-object values after the web looked too glossy.",
